{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":127,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"b6b0b27f-12c8-43f5-9c4a-458e5c5a4444","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511223756,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"【宜凯德】医学事务专员(J15238)","OrgId":3980408,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 收集培训需求，协助制定临床培训计划与排期\n2. 协助开发疾病、产品与术式带教课程，制作课件与操作手册\n3. 组织培训班、科室会与实操带教，负责讲师协调与会务\n4. 对接临床专家讲师，维护讲师库与授课台账\n5. 跟踪培训考核与满意度，确保培训内容合规","Require":"1. 本科及以上应届毕业生，临床医学、护理学、药学、生物医学工程等相关专业\n2. 具备临床基础知识与英文文献阅读能力，能读懂指南与说明书\n3. 课件开发与表达授课能力强，逻辑清晰、善于把专业内容讲明白\n4. 会务组织与协作能力好，合规意识高，可接受适度出差","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-23T18:18:49","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"2eb24ebb-c97f-4919-97c6-0879b80b46b5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511223204,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"项目主管(J15237)","OrgId":3980408,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.负责综合类项目管理和实施管理，协助业务部门完成从项目立项至项目验收的全过程管理；\n2.负责完善、修订项目管理制度体系；\n3.协调解决项目重大风险、问题，监控项目群进度。\n4.负责落实项目管理制度，负责项目宣传和培训工作。","Require":"1.本科以上学历，两年以上项目管理或业务管理经验，具备IT背景或IT经验；\n2.较强的沟通协作能力，能够独立承担项目管理工作，具备项目规划和推进能力；\n3.较强的责任心与抗压能力，以及目标导向的落地执行能力、问题解决能力；\n4.较强的逻辑思维能力及快速学习能力；\n5.PMP证书或者软考项目管理相关证书拥有者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-22T15:53:50","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"5dfef88f-2dff-4814-b998-b354dbd39420","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511223201,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"网络工程师(J15236)","OrgId":3980408,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 负责大型企业园区网络（含核心、汇聚、接入层）的日常运维、故障排查与性能优化，保障网络7×24小时稳定运行；\n2. 负责数据中心网络（含Spine-Leaf架构、VXLAN）的规划、部署与维护，配合服务器、存储团队完成网络联调；\n3. 负责园区及机房网络设备的配置管理、版本升级、补丁更新与变更实施，确保操作合规、可追溯；\n4. 负责网络监控体系建设，通过Zabbix、PRTG等工具实现流量、链路、设备状态的实时监控与告警闭环；\n5. 参与网络架构优化项目，包括带宽扩容、链路冗余、无线覆盖优化等；\n6. 负责机房基础设施（含UPS、精密空调、动环监控、综合布线）的日常巡检与故障处理；\n7. 编制并维护网络拓扑图、IP地址规划表、设备台账、应急预案等技术文档；\n8. 负责防火墙、IPSec VPN、SD-WAN等安全与广域网设备的策略配置、运维与故障处理，保障网络安全与跨站点互联稳定。","Require":"学历与经验：\n1. 本科及以上学历，计算机、通信、网络工程等相关专业；3年以上大型企业园区网络或数据中心网络运维经验，有制造业、金融、互联网行业背景者优先。\n2. 技术能力：\n● 精通华为园区网络与数据中心网络设备的配置与调试，包括交换机、路由器、无线AC/AP等，持有华为HCIP或HCIE认证者优先；\n 精通TCP/IP、OSPF、VLAN、STP、VRRP、HSRP、ETH-Trunk等路由交换协议，能独立完成大型网络故障定位；\n● 熟悉IPSec VPN的部署与运维，包括站点到站点VPN、远程接入VPN的隧道建立、密钥协商与故障排查；\n● 熟悉SD-WAN解决方案，具备SD-WAN分支接入、流量调度、链路质量检测等运维经验；\n● 熟悉数据中心网络技术，包括VXLAN、M-LAG/CSS /IStack ，BFD+路由联动、ECMP等价路由\n● 熟悉无线网络（Wi-Fi 6/7）规划与优化，有华为无线项目经验者优先；\n● 熟悉网络监控与自动化工具，如Zabbix、Prometheus、Ansible、Python网络脚本编写者优先；\n● 具备机房基础设施运维能力，熟悉UPS、精密空调、动环监控系统的基本原理与故障处理。\n3. 软性能力：\n● 具备较强的故障分析与逻辑推理能力，能在压力下快速定位并解决网络问题；\n● 良好的文档编写能力，能输出清晰的技术方案、故障报告与运维手册；\n● 具备跨部门沟通协调能力，能与服务器、数据库、安全、应用团队高效协作；\n● 责任心强，能适应夜间或周末的紧急变更与故障处理。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-22T15:48:38","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"7edbfc6b-b9e8-4f2a-ab71-a57efcb8dc46","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511221516,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"【血液净化集团】—模具工程师(J15235)","OrgId":3980411,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.系统学习注塑模具结构、加工工艺及注塑成型原理。\n2.在资深工程师指导下，协助完成模具3D/2D图纸的绘制、BOM表整理及基础DFM分析。\n3.深入车间，参与模具的加工、装配、试模及验收全过程，协助收集并记录试模数据。\n4.协助分析试模及量产过程中的成型缺陷（如飞边、缩水等），学习工艺参数调整及模具优化方案。\n5.协助编制和维护模具技术档案、操作指导书及加工工艺卡等标准化文件。","Require":"1.2026/27届本科/硕士应届毕业生，机械设计制造、材料成型及控制工程、模具设计等相关专业。\n2.了解或初步掌握UG/NX、SolidWorks、AutoCAD等至少一种机械制图/模具设计软件。\n3.具备扎实的机械制图与材料力学基础，对注塑模具行业有浓厚兴趣，有志于深耕模具技术领域。\n4.在校期间有模具设计相关课题、竞赛获奖经历，或具备相关实习经验者优先考虑。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-16T15:42:31","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"9ea55d41-0ce0-482d-acd2-45b86bb96974","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511221512,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"【血液净化集团】—纺丝工艺工程师(J15234)","OrgId":3980411,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.系统学习聚砜（PS）/聚醚砜（PES）中空纤维膜的湿法纺丝原理、相转移成孔机理及透析器核心制造工艺。\n2.深入纺丝车间，全程跟进原液配制、纺丝、水洗牵伸、卷绕等全流程，协助收集并记录关键工艺参数与生产数据。\n3.参与新配方、新工艺的小试与中试工作，协助完成样品制备、性能测试及试验数据整理。\n4.协助排查纺丝过程中的断丝、毛丝、成孔不均等工艺异常，学习并参与制定整改闭环方案，提升良品率。\n5.协助编制、修订纺丝工艺标准、作业指导书（SOP）等技术文件，参与一线操作员工的工艺规范培训。","Require":"1.硕士及以上学历，高分子材料与工程、化学工程与工艺、纺织工程、材料科学等相关专业。\n2.具备扎实的高分子化学、高分子物理及材料加工成型基础，对湿法纺丝或中空纤维膜技术有浓厚兴趣。\n3.具备较强的数据分析能力与逻辑思维能力；动手能力强，严谨细致。\n4.责任心强，具备良好的沟通协作能力与抗压能力，愿意扎根医疗器械/高分子材料行业长期发展。\n5.在校期间参与过高分子材料、纺丝或膜材料相关课题/实验，或有相关实习经历者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-16T15:36:50","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"9a3f89e3-79bb-4712-b2b4-c4a70f5a0259","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511221064,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"【集团总部】财务专员(J15232)","OrgId":3980408,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、核算处理：协助完成集团总部日常账务处理